&lt;h3 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;2.5  创建草图 
    &lt;div id=&#34;25--%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%E8%8D%89%E5%9B%BE&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 ltr:-left-6 rtl:-right-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700&#34;
            style=&#34;text-decoration-line: none !important;&#34; href=&#34;#25--%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%E8%8D%89%E5%9B%BE&#34; aria-label=&#34;锚点&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;        
    
&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;右键特征下的XY→创建草图，弹出草图编辑框。&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;figure&gt;
        &lt;img
          class=&#34;my-0 rounded-md&#34;
          srcset=&#34;
          /blogs/star-ccm&amp;#43;/ccmblog1/ccm1/ccmb10_hu12910896789009890179.png 330w,
          /blogs/star-ccm&amp;#43;/ccmblog1/ccm1/ccmb10_hu5102072609025838370.png 660w,
          /blogs/star-ccm&amp;#43;/ccmblog1/ccm1/ccmb10_hu14946685228274451139.png 1024w,
          /blogs/star-ccm&amp;#43;/ccmblog1/ccm1/ccmb10_hu2332714785502786316.png 2x&#34;
          src=&#34;https://zbianc.github.io/blogs/star-ccm&amp;#43;/ccmblog1/ccm1/ccmb10_hu5102072609025838370.png&#34;
          alt=&#34;&#34;
        /&gt;
  
  
  &lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;p&gt;在左侧显示选项中点击如图所示红方框按钮设置网格间距为0.02m。点击确定。&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;figure&gt;
        &lt;img
          class=&#34;my-0 rounded-md&#34;
          srcset=&#34;
          /blogs/star-ccm&amp;#43;/ccmblog1/ccm1/ccmb11_hu8646919411138150090.png 330w,
          /blogs/star-ccm&amp;#43;/ccmblog1/ccm1/ccmb11_hu16039732120913941547.png 660w,
